36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Asuka**: The ledger shows seventy percent of costs are fixed, regardless of attendance. The taster forms reveal newcomers fear a full-year commitment.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
